keyboard geometry）处理逻辑中存在越界读取漏洞，具体位于 `CheckSetGeom()` 与 `XkbAddGeomKeyAlias` 函数中。这些函数在解析或设置几何数据时未正确校验缓冲区边界，导致攻击者可读取未初始化或越界的内存内容。攻击者只需能够连接到 X11 服务器（本地或远程），且无需用户交互即可触发该漏洞。成功利用可导致内存内容泄露（机密性影响高），或通过使服务器崩溃造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 X.Org X Server 及 Xwayland 等产品，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34000"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-05T16:16:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:38:24Z","remediation":"建议升级 X.Org X server 到修复版本：Debian 用户将 xorg-server 升级至 bookworm 2:21.1.7-3+deb12u12、trixie 2:21.1.16-1.3+deb13u3 或 sid 2:21.1.23-1 以上；Xwayland 升级至 2:24.1.12-1 以上（源码修复提交：gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/xserver 提交 81b6a34f）。升级前临时缓解：禁用 XKB 几何信息请求，限制仅可信用户访问 X11（通过 xhost 或仅监听本地 unix socket），并以非 root 低权限用户运行 Xwayland；同时通过防火墙阻断对 6000/tcp 及 6001/tcp 的远程 X11 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19342","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20547","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20555","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20557","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20558","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20560","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20561","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20562","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20563","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20575","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20576","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20590","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21699","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21712","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21715","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21716","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21718","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21741","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21742","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22424","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22456","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:23254","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:23255","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:23496","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:24341","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-34000","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2451107","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-34000","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-34000.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/21c462a94ea67aa3df9bc7055065922b0908d166/content/posts/cve-2026-34000.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c3ce9ce6c4e880427d4f61012130da140c93b7d7/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-34000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0731.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0738","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0738.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34032","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_proxy_ajp 堆缓冲区过度读取漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_proxy_ajp 模块中 ajp_msg_get_string 函数存在缺失空终止检查导致的堆缓冲区过度读取漏洞。攻击者可通过发送特制的 AJP 请求触发越界读取，泄露服务器内存中的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.66 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.3（中危），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需权限和用户交互。建议升级至 2.4.67 版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34032"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-04T14:16:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:38:28Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 到 2.4.67 或更高版本以修复 mod_proxy_ajp 中的堆缓冲区过度读取漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在配置文件中禁用 mod_proxy_ajp 模块（注释掉 LoadModule proxy_ajp_module），或在防火墙层面限制 AJP 端口（默认 8009）仅允许受信任的后端服务器访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/04/16","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2026/CVE-2026-34032.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c3b619fb02eed1c084cf7dca0b26d6106b797434/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-340xx/CVE-2026-34032.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2026-34032-2026-05-07-0905","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2026-34032-2026-07-31-0005"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0738.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0122","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-7482","title":"Ollama GGUF 堆越界读取漏洞","description":"Ollama 0.17.1 之前版本的 GGUF 模型加载器中存在堆越界读取漏洞。攻击者可通过 /api/create 端点上传特制的 GGUF 文件，其中声明的张量偏移和大小超过文件实际长度，导致服务器在量化处理时读取越界堆内存，泄露环境变量、API 密钥、系统提示词及并发用户会话数据等敏感信息，并可通过 /api/push 端点将泄露数据外传至攻击者控制的镜像仓库。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，尽管默认绑定 127.0.0.1，但实际广泛配置为 OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0 导致大量公网暴露。建议升级至 0.17.1 或更高版本，并限制 /api/create 和 /api/push 端点访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-7482"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-04T13:16:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T11:02:30Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Ollama 0.17.1 或更高版本（含 commit 88d57d0483cca）。临时缓解措施：限制 /api/create 和 /api/push 端点的外部访问，仅允许受信任的内网 IP 调用；禁止将 OLLAMA_HOST 设置为 0.0.0.0；在反向代理层对上传的 GGUF 文件大小和张量偏移进行校验；启用身份认证并轮换已暴露的 API 密钥和凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ollama/ollama/commit/88d57d0483cca907e0b23a968c83627a20b21047","https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/14406","https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.17.1","https://github.com/0x0OZ/CVE-2026-7482-PoC","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/367702ad7530a5ba67c1bf5ac2a64f2d7987df9f/data/vuln/ollama/CVE-2026-7482.yaml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e63a3bc2cfe23f772acd778fdda486ce9e91d32a/2026/CVE-2026-7482.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-7482.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/fdf19595af0ac0832011c9bde3da2f545d136f2f/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-7482.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-05/%E3%80%90%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A%E3%80%91Ollama%20%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2026-7482).md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-05-04/TIER_2_CVE-2026-7482.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/7xxx/CVE-2026-7482.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/go/github.com/ollama/ollama/CVE-2026-7482.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-7482/README.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-7482/forge.py","https://github.com/msuiche/gguf_cve2026_7482","https://github.com/kaleth4/CVE-2026-7482","https://github.com/szybnev/CVE-2026-7482","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-7482"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0122.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0070","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-31694","title":"Linux Kernel FUSE page cache 越界写本地提权漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 FUSE 文件系统驱动在处理 page cache 中的目录项时存在越界写漏洞（CWE-787）。fuse_add_dirent_to_cache() 函数未对由 FUSE 服务器控制的 namelen 字段进行大小校验，仅检查当前页面剩余空间是否足够，忽略了目录项本身可能超过单页大小（4KiB）。攻击者可通过挂载恶意 FUSE 服务器并返回精心构造的 namelen=4095 的超长目录项，触发 memcpy 越界写入后续内核页面 24 字节，造成本地权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用 4KiB 内存页的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。需升级内核至 6.18.25+ 或 7.0.2+ 版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-31694"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-01T14:16:19Z","updated":"2026-07-02T15:16:59Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.18.25+ 或 7.0.2+ 版本（对应发行版请安装相应安全更新）。如无法立即更新，可剥离 fusermount3 的 setuid 权限并限制非特权用户命名空间创建，或在不需 FUSE 的系统上禁用 FUSE 内核模块（modprobe -r fuse），防止恶意 FUSE 服务器触发越界写。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/474ce83c96a55f2eeb14dee2be375eeadfdacdf5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/51a8de6c50bf947c8f534cd73da4c8f0a13e7bed","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7de93abfaae1b2dc94da8a07a36421bd073f1d8f","https://github.com/0xCyberstan/CVE-2026-31694-POC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-31694.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.05/CVE-2026-31694%EF%BC%9ALinux%20FUSE%20page%20cache%20%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-31694.md","https://github.com/bottlerocket-os/bottlerocket/blob/ce59f61e34745243624ba6386f41c1b63f9fadac/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/d17870d3de3988e949c161d788c25e4dfe158dac/2026/CVE-2026-31694.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-31694","https://github.com/microsoft/msft-linux-cve-analysis/blob/a841a405d027c9fb5457a22ca062dd95b1555c5d/vulns/CVE-2026-31694.yml_reasoning.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/edea45bcf3f5f232d6349d094e3ed87f8aba3ba7/doc/2026-07/%E3%80%90%E5%B7%B2%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%E3%80%91Linux%20FUSE%20page%20cache%20%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2026-31694)%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-31694.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-31694"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0079","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42249","title":"Ollama Ollama for Windows 更新路径遍历远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ollama for Windows 更新机制中存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），由于程序在下载更新时未对 HTTP 响应头中的字段进行有效验证，直接将攻击者可控的头部值传递给 filepath.Join 函数拼接本地文件路径，攻击者可通过中间人攻击或篡改更新服务器响应，在 HTTP 响应头中注入 `../` 等路径遍历序列，将恶意可执行文件写入当前用户可访问的任意路径，包括 Windows 启动目录。结合 CVE-2026-42248（更新签名验证缺失漏洞），攻击者可实现无用户交互的自动恶意载荷投放与持久化代码执行。该漏洞影响 Ollama for Windows 0.12.10 至 0.17.5 版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。厂商截至漏洞披露时未提供官方修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42249"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-04-29T12:16:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:47:34Z","remediation":"目前厂商未发布官方修复版本，建议持续关注 Ollama 官方发布页获取补丁。临时缓解措施：(1) 在防火墙或代理层面阻止 ollama.com 的更新服务器通信，防止恶意更新响应注入；(2) 为 Windows 启动目录 `%APPDATA%\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup` 和更新暂存目录 `%APPDATA%\\Ollama` 设置严格的 ACL 写入权限，仅允许 Administrators 组写入；(3) 使用进程监视工具（如 Sysmon）监控 ollama.exe 的异常子进程创建行为；(4) 如不使用自动更新功能，可通过组策略或注册表禁用 Ollama 的后台更新服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cert.pl/en/posts/2026/04/CVE-2026-42248/","https://ollama.com/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/2026/42xxx/CVE-2026-42249.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/fdf19595af0ac0832011c9bde3da2f545d136f2f/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-42249.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-42249.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b49e13cf2d645af804096640daf5e00cefbce237/2026/42xxx/CVE-2026-42249.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-42249.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Ollama_for_Windows_%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-42249.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-7mp6-jmch-f3fh/GHSA-7mp6-jmch-f3fh.json","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/3f2acec982f481baf5c6de52f97626de9b65e5d4/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-42249.md","https://github.com/OWASP/AISVS/blob/94fbad5acee4e4716bff263a4c455dfd780e53a7/1.0/research/chapters/C09-Orchestration-and-Agents/C09-Orchestration-and-Agents.md","https://github.com/ugurkocde/IntuneBrew/blob/9d2d092535ea7a591ee0359f050875deb2adde69/CVE/ollama.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-42249"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0078","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42248","title":"Ollama Ollama for Windows 更新签名缺失远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ollama for Windows 的自动更新机制存在下载包完整性验证缺失漏洞（CWE-494），其 Windows 平台的更新验证函数始终返回成功状态，导致无论数字签名是否有效，下载的更新程序均会被执行。攻击者可通过中间人攻击或劫持更新通道替换为恶意程序，利用 Ollama 静默自动更新机制在用户无感知情况下安装任意代码。该漏洞影响 Ollama for Windows 0.12.10 至 0.17.5 版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。厂商截至披露时未发布官方修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42248"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-04-29T12:16:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:47:34Z","remediation":"截至漏洞披露，Ollama 官方未发布修复版本。立即将 Ollama for Windows 降级或替换为可手动校验更新的版本；在防火墙/代理层面拦截 `update.ollama.ai` 域名及 `%APPDATA%\\Ollama\\update` 目录的出站请求，彻底阻断自动更新通道；使用 Windows AppLocker 或软件限制策略锁定 `ollama.exe` 仅允许执行受信任路径下的已签名二进制；删除 `%APPDATA%\\Ollama\\update` 目录中所有非手动确认的 `.exe` 文件并移除该目录的写入权限；在系统计划任务和启动项中排查并清除由恶意更新添加的持久化条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cert.pl/en/posts/2026/04/CVE-2026-42248/","https://ollama.com/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/2026/42xxx/CVE-2026-42248.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/fdf19595af0ac0832011c9bde3da2f545d136f2f/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-42248.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/42xxx/CVE-2026-42248.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-42248.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-42248.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Ollama_for_Windows_%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%AD%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%BC%BA%E5%A4%B1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-42248.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-5fjh-wjgp-25ph/GHSA-5fjh-wjgp-25ph.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-42248.json","https://github.com/OWASP/AISVS/blob/94fbad5acee4e4716bff263a4c455dfd780e53a7/1.0/research/chapters/C03-Model-Lifecycle-Management/C03-02-Model-Validation-Testing.md","https://github.com/k4w-wak/ollama-silent-patches/blob/e25e34a05166dc51d717a843e1deddd3e70173cc/README.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-42248"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0075","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-40453","title":"Apache Camel 多协议消息头注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Camel 存在 header 注入漏洞，该漏洞是 CVE-2025-27636 修复不完整导致：官方在 HttpHeaderFilterStrategy 中添加了 setLowerCase(true) 以过滤大小写变体头名称，但未同步应用于 JmsHeaderFilterStrategy、SjmsHeaderFilterStrategy、CoAPHeaderFilterStrategy、GooglePubsubHeaderFilterStrategy 等五个非 HTTP 协议的 HeaderFilterStrategy 实现。这些策略使用大小写敏感的 String.startsWith('Camel'/'camel') 过滤，而 Camel Exchange 以大小写不敏感的 Map 存储头信息，导致拥有 JMS/CoAP/Google PubSub 消息生产者权限的攻击者可通过注入大小写变种的 Camel 内部头，使下游组件（如 camel-exec、camel-file）解析为原始大小写的可执行头，从而实现远程代码执行和任意文件写入。该漏洞影响 Apache Camel 3.0.0 至 4.14.6 之前、4.15.0 至 4.18.2 之前、4.19.0 至 4.20.0 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-40453"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-04-27T09:16:01Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:21:05Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Apache Camel 4.20.0（最新稳定版），LTS 用户升级至 4.14.6，4.18.x 用户升级至 4.18.2。临时缓解措施：① 自定义 HeaderFilterStrategy，覆盖 setLowerCase(true) 强制大小写折叠过滤；② 在路由入口添加 removeHeaders(\"Camel*\", \"camel*\") 并设置 ignoreCase=true 清除所有 Camel 内部头；③ 限制 JMS/CoAP/Google PubSub 等协议的未授权 producer 访问消息代理；④ 审查依赖 camel-exec/camel-file 等高危组件的 consumer，避免直接消费不可信来源的协议消息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://camel.apache.org/security/CVE-2026-40453.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:17668","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19835","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-40453","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2463173","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-40453.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-40453.json","https://github.com/apache/camel-website/blob/065bea5ebe5f2801b404853fd107b1c4a22f5e53/content/security/CVE-2026-40453.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-04-27/TIER_2_CVE-2026-40453.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/d17870d3de3988e949c161d788c25e4dfe158dac/2026/CVE-2026-40453.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/maven/org.apache.camel/camel-jms/CVE-2026-40453.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-40453.md","https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/click-to-deploy/blob/f14acfa75f32791c391c723fe3b94a90d6922917/docker/activemq/6/debian12/6.1/Dockerfile","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Apache_Camel_Header_%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-40453.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-40453.md","https://github.com/apache/camel/blob/439f20faf0bf91527fa21253fad32ab7b60bee5a/docs/user-manual/modules/ROOT/pages/security-model.adoc","https://github.com/oscerd/CVE-2026-40453","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-40453"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1003","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-41276","title":"FlowiseAI Flowise 密码重置认证绕过漏洞","description":"Flowise 是一款用于构建大语言模型流程的拖放式用户界面工具。在 3.1.0 版本之前，该软件的 AccountService 类中的 resetPassword 方法未对密码重置令牌进行有效性校验，未检查令牌是否实际生成。默认情况下，用户账户的重置令牌为 null 值或在历史密码重置后为空字符串。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需获取目标用户的邮箱地址，即可向 \"/api/v1/account/reset-password\" 端点发送包含 null 或空字符串重置令牌的伪造请求，将该用户的登录密码重置为任意值，从而绕过认证机制完全接管账户。该漏洞影响 Flowise 3.1.0 以下的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 7.7，危害等级高。FlowiseAI 已在 3.1.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-41276"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-23T20:16:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:46:25Z","remediation":"立即将 Flowise 升级到 3.1.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 AccountService.resetPassword 方法中未校验密码重置令牌是否实际生成的逻辑缺陷。如暂时无法升级，可通过反向代理或防火墙规则限制对 /api/v1/account/reset-password 端点的外部访问，或在 Flowise 配置中临时禁用密码重置功能以阻止攻击者利用 null 或空字符串令牌绕过认证。升级完成后，应强制所有用户重新设置密码，并检查系统中是否存在异常的密码重置日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise/security/advisories/GHSA-f6hc-c5jr-878p","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41276.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flowise/CVE-2026-41276.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flowise/CVE-2026-41276.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41276.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41276.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-41276.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-41276.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2026/CVE-2026-41276.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-41276.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-41276.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-1003.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-1003.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1000","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-41265","title":"Flowise Airtable Agent 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Flowise 是一个用于构建大语言模型流程的拖放式用户界面。在 3.1.0 版本之前，该产品的 Airtable Agent 和 CSV Agent 节点中 run 方法存在代码注入漏洞。由于在通过 Pyodide 执行 LLM 生成的 Python 脚本时缺乏适当的沙箱隔离机制，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过提示词注入技术，向使用了 Airtable Agent 或 CSV Agent 节点的聊天流程发送恶意提示，诱使 LLM 生成包含攻击者控制命令的 Python 脚本，从而在 Flowise 服务器上执行任意代码并获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响所有启用了 Airtable Agent 或 CSV Agent 节点的 Flowise 实例，攻击者无需任何凭据即可发起远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。此外受影响版本还可能存在图数据库 Cypher 注入和向量存储路径遍历等其他安全风险。Flowise 已在 3.1.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-41265"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-23T20:16:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:46:24Z","remediation":"立即将Flowise升级至3.1.0或更高版本，官方修复了Airtable Agent节点缺乏Python脚本沙箱隔离的漏洞。如无法立即升级，临时措施包括：删除或禁用使用Airtable Agent节点的所有chatflow；在防火墙或反向代理层限制Flowise管理界面的访问IP，仅允许可信地址访问；监控服务器异常子进程创建和出站网络连接，发现可疑活动立即隔离。同时检查是否使用了GraphCypherQAChain和Vector Store basePath相关功能，这些组件在相同版本中也存在Cypher注入和路径遍历漏洞，需一并评估。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise/security/advisories/GHSA-v38x-c887-992f","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41265.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flowise/CVE-2026-41265.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flowise/CVE-2026-41265.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41265.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41265.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-41265.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-41265.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/6dc0e7eb426eec01d83904a899cb3678dfef08ad/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-41265.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2026/CVE-2026-41265.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-41265.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-1000.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-1000.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0997","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0997.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-41264","title":"Flowise CSV Agent 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Flowise 是一款用于构建自定义大语言模型流程的拖拽式用户界面，其 3.1.0 之前版本的 CSV_Agents 类中存在沙箱逃逸漏洞。该漏洞源于 CSV Agent 节点在评估 LLM 生成的 Python 脚本时缺乏适当的沙箱隔离机制，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用 CSV Agent 节点的聊天流发送精心构造的提示词，利用提示注入技术诱导大语言模型生成恶意 Python 脚本，从而在 Flowise 服务器上执行任意系统命令。攻击者已可在 Flowise 3.1.2 版本上通过 Pyodide 代码注入获得 root 权限的 Meterpreter 反向 Shell，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 9.2。建议升级至 3.1.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-41264"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-23T20:16:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:46:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Flowise 到 3.1.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。如暂时无法升级，应禁用或删除所有使用 CSV Agent 节点的 chatflow，并通过防火墙或反向代理限制只有可信 IP 才能访问 Flowise 管理界面与 API，同时监控服务器是否存在异常 Python 进程或可疑出站连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise/security/advisories/GHSA-3hjv-c53m-58jj","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41264.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flowise/CVE-2026-41264.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flowise/CVE-2026-41264.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41264.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/20c018f1a1b9bca1242ee2249074773858b2a0ac/2026/41xxx/CVE-2026-41264.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/929b6ea1a1a05b6cd00f9afcd22053f36ec0c5dc/modules/exploits/multi/http/flowise_auth_rce_cve_2026_41264.rb","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-41264.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-41264.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/74ae6f2c8127e0fdd68910c