9cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-34001","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-34001.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/21c462a94ea67aa3df9bc7055065922b0908d166/content/posts/cve-2026-34001.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c3ce9ce6c4e880427d4f61012130da140c93b7d7/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-34001.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0732.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0559","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-33999","title":"X.Org X server XKB整数下溢漏洞","description":"tags.<value>X.Org X server 的 XKB 兼容映射（compatibility map）处理逻辑中存在整数下溢漏洞（CWE-191）。当攻击者构造特制的键盘兼容映射数据时，相关代码在下溢后进行内存读取操作，从而触发缓冲区读取越界（buffer read overrun），破坏内存安全约束。该漏洞影响 X.Org X server 及基于其架构的 Xwayland 等实现，广泛波及使用 X11 的 Linux/Unix 桌面环境。攻击者需具备对 X11 服务器的本地或远程访问能力，且需拥有本地低权限账户（CVSS 向量 AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H），攻击复杂度较低且无需用户交互。利用该漏洞可导致内存越界读取，轻则造成拒绝服务（DoS），重则可能进一步升级为内存破坏、信息泄露甚至任意代码执行。该漏洞由 ZDI（ZDI-26-333 / ZDI-CAN-28593）报告，CVSS 评分为 7.8，危害等级为高危，各 Linux 发行版厂商（如 Red Hat）已将其标记为重要安全更新，建议及时升级 X.Org 及 Xwayland 相关软件包。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-33999"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-23T16:16:24Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:20:27Z","remediation":"The user wants me to fix the [remediation] field for CVE-2026-33999. The presearch data has concrete fix version info from Debian tracker:\n- xorg-server 2:21.1.22-1 (fixed)\n- trixie: xorg-server 2:21.1.16-1.3+deb13u2\n- bookworm: xorg-server 2:21.1.7-3+deb12u12\n\nAlso X.Org announcement link: https://lists.x.org/archives/xorg-announce/2026-April/003677.html\n\nRed Hat erratas RHSA-2026:10739 etc.\n\nI should write a concrete, actionable Chinese remediation ≥20 chars, citing the Debian fixed versions and Red Hat errata.\n\nLet me craft the remediation field value.<value>建议立即升级 X.Org X server 及 Xwayland 至官方修复版本：根据 Debian 安全通告，Debian unstable 修复版本为 xorg-server 2:21.1.22-1，trixie 为 2:21.1.16-1.3+deb13u2，bookworm 为 2:21.1.7-3+deb12u12；Red Hat 各产品线已发布 RHSA-2026:10739、RHSA-2026:11352 等安全更新（详见 https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-33999），请使用发行版包管理工具安装对应补丁包（如 `apt upgrade xorg-server xwayland`、`yum","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:10739","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:11352","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:11369","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:11388","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:11656","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:11692","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:13414","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19125","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19342","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19343","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19344","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20547","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20555","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20557","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20558","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA